<title>USA: American International Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>American International Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.66		    $1.42</p>
<p> Shr as adjusted 1.60		     1.38</p>
<p> Net		 780,900		  671,200</p>
<p> Revs		7,190,000		6,580,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  469,506		  473,970</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus estimate was $1.58 a share.</p>
<p>Q1 income as adjusted was $750.6 million compared with $652.3 million a year ago.  </p>
<p>Adjusted income excludes realized capital gains net of taxes.</p>
<p>Combined ratio was 96.25 percent vs 96.79 percent a year ago.</p>
</text>
